      "content": "hotlines don't really change anything though. they don't change the fact that no matter how hard i try, i'm still just gonna be this person in a world that doesn't want me to be. it feels like a cycle that never ends and i'm just... i'm just so exhausted by the whole thing. it feels pointless.",
